{"unit_id":"tag:08U6:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节使用朴素余切复形（naive cotangent complex）来做一些形变理论（deformation theory）。我们从一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0001>开始，它是带环空间（ringed spaces）的增厚。记<MATH_0002>，并将<MATH_0003>与<MATH_0004>的底拓扑空间（topological spaces）等同。此外，假设给定带环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）<MATH_0005>、一个<MATH_0006>模（module）<MATH_0007>以及一个<MATH_0008>映射（map）<MATH_0009>，它是模（modules）层（sheaves）的映射（《层（Sheaves）》，定义<REF_0001>和第<REF_0002>节）。本节要问，能否找到一个问号位置的对象，使之嵌入下图（diagram）<MATH_0010>（其中竖直箭头（vertical arrows）是<MATH_0011>映射（maps）），以及解（solution）在多大程度上唯一（若它存在）。更准确地，我们寻找一阶增厚（first order thickening）<MATH_0012>，以及增厚（thickenings）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，如（<REF_0003>）中所示，其中<MATH_0014>与<MATH_0015>等同，使得<MATH_0016>诱导给定的映射（map）<MATH_0017>。我们称<MATH_0018>为（<REF_0004>）的一个<TEXTITOPEN_0001>解（solution）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形"},{"source_term":"deformation theory","target_term":"形变理论"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"vertical arrows","target_term":"竖直箭头"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"naive cotangent complex","target_term":"朴素余切复形","context":"本节使用的复形。"},{"source_term":"deformation theory","target_term":"形变理论","context":"本节主题。"},{"source_term":"first order thickening","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"所给与所求的增厚。"},{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"增厚涉及的空间。"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"被等同的底空间。"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射","context":"所给的结构态射。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"结构层上的模。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定的层映射。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"层的模结构。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"给定层。"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"所求增厚嵌入的图。"},{"source_term":"vertical arrows","target_term":"竖直箭头","context":"图中的竖直映射。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"图中的映射。"},{"source_term":"solution","target_term":"解","context":"增厚问题的解。"},{"source_term":"thickenings","target_term":"增厚","context":"所求态射的对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所求增厚的态射。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08U8:statement","translation":"假设给定带环空间（ringed spaces）的态射（morphisms）的交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0001>，其中水平（horizontal）箭头（arrows）是一阶增厚（first order thickenings）。置<MATH_0002>，并假设给定模（modules）的一个<MATH_0003>映射（map）<MATH_0004>，给出交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0005>，其前面和后面都是（<REF_0001>）的解（solutions）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>存在一个典范（canonical）元素（element），属于<MATH_0006>，其消失（vanishing）是存在带环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）<MATH_0007>，嵌入（<REF_0002>）并与<MATH_0008>相容（compatibly）的充要条件（necessary and sufficient condition）。\n<STRUCT_0003>若存在态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，嵌入（<REF_0003>）并与<MATH_0010>相容（compatibly），则所有这样态射（morphisms）的集合（set）是<MATH_0011>下的一个主齐性空间（principal homogeneous space）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"compatibly","target_term":"相容"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"compatibly","target_term":"相容"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间","context":"所给图的空间。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"带环空间的态射。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"所给的图。"},{"source_term":"horizontal","target_term":"水平","context":"图中箭头的方向。"},{"source_term":"arrows","target_term":"箭头","context":"图中的态射。"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"水平增厚。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"给定映射的对象。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定模映射。"},{"source_term":"solutions","target_term":"解","context":"图前面与后面的增厚。"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"自然的障碍元素。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"Ext 中的障碍。"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失","context":"障碍为零。"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射","context":"所求的态射。"},{"source_term":"compatibly","target_term":"相容","context":"与给定映射相容。"},{"source_term":"necessary and sufficient condition","target_term":"充要条件","context":"所求态射存在的判据。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"第二结论中的态射。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"所有这样态射的集合。"},{"source_term":"principal homogeneous space","target_term":"主齐性空间","context":"Hom 群作用的空间。"}],"notes":["remark：原文 There exist a canonical element 的语法疑点留档；未改变元素存在的数学断言。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0GPZ:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为带环空间的态射（morphism of ringed spaces）。令<MATH_0002>为一个<MATH_0003>模（module）。<MATH_0004>代数（algebras）的扩张（extensions）<MATH_0005>的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set），其中<MATH_0006>是平方零理想（ideal of square zero）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>换言之，是一阶增厚（first order thickenings）<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>上，附有同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0009>，作为<MATH_0010>模（modules）的同构，所组成的同构类（isomorphism classes）的集合（set）。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001> \n与<MATH_0011>典范双射（canonically bijective）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"ideal of square zero","target_term":"平方零理想"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"canonically bijective","target_term":"典范双射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed spaces","target_term":"带环空间的态射","context":"所给的态射。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定模。"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数","context":"相对结构层的代数。"},{"source_term":"extensions","target_term":"扩张","context":"平方零代数扩张。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism classes","target_term":"同构类","context":"扩张及带结构增厚的类。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"这些同构类的集合。"},{"source_term":"ideal of square zero","target_term":"平方零理想","context":"扩张的理想核。"},{"source_term":"first order thickenings","target_term":"一阶增厚","context":"脚注的等价描述。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"理想与给定模的同构。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"脚注中同构的模结构。"},{"source_term":"canonically bijective","target_term":"典范双射","context":"与 Ext 群的自然对应。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0GQ0:statement","translation":"令<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>如引理<REF_0001>中所示。考虑扩张（extension）<MATH_0003>，如该引理中所示。可以选择集合（sets）层（sheaf）<MATH_0004>以及交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0005>，使得<MATH_0006>是满射（surjective）的，核（kernel）为<MATH_0007>。（例如，可以取任意集合（sets）层（sheaf），满射（surjecting）到<MATH_0008>。）那么<MATH_0009>。见《模（Modules）》，第<REF_0002>节，特别是引理<REF_0003>。当然，<MATH_0010>决定一个映射（map）<MATH_0011>，它又决定一个映射（map）<MATH_0012>，它又决定<MATH_0013>中的元素（element），该元素通过引理的双射（bijection）对应于<MATH_0014>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjecting","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"bijection","target_term":"双射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"给定代数扩张。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"集合层的取值。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"选定的集合层。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"展示的图。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"所给映射的性质。"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"该满射的核。"},{"source_term":"surjecting","target_term":"满射","context":"集合层满射到给定层。"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模","context":"引用章节。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"依次确定的映射。"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"对应的 Ext 元素。"},{"source_term":"bijection","target_term":"双射","context":"引理给出的自然对应。"}],"notes":[]}
